%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Epilogue9_2_PostRadio
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: "Kade, we\u2019ve lost them. Nothing but white noise."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391555
  - content: Strange. These high-amplitude radios should punch through solid bedrock.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391556
    - rid: 314095765763391572
    - rid: 314095765763391557
    - rid: 314095765763391558
    - rid: 314095765763391571
  - content: "The blackout isn\u2019t because of anything geological."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f83f78016c814045855f5b9c9f437fa, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Well, protocol says to backtrack to the last known location with a
      clear signal. So... we\u2019ll wait."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391559
  - content: 'A couple hours pass, with no hint of a reply. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391560
  - content: Even on foot, a backtrack doesn't take this long. What exactly were
      the details of their last report?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391561
    - rid: 314095765763391562
    - rid: 314095765763391563
    - rid: 314095765763391564
  - content: "Their last report was... strange. They said they kept running into
      dead ends where tunnels that shouldn't end just\u2026 stopped?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391565
  - content: 'They said they were turning back to the main shaft to regroup... And
      then nothing. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "We're not waiting any longer. Let\u2019s mobilize a rescue team."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391566
  - content: "Something\u2019s gone wrong up there."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: <i>The camp springs into action. Jackie, using her staff as support,
      but otherwise looking much stronger, motions to join the search.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391567
    - rid: 314095765763391568
    - rid: 314095765763391569
    - rid: 314095765763391570
  - content: Rocky. I'm going.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391573
    - rid: 314095765763391574
    - rid: 314095765763391577
    - rid: 314095765763391575
    - rid: 314095765763391576
  - content: Don't be ridiculous. You can hardly walk.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391578
    - rid: 314095765763391579
    - rid: 314095765763391580
  - content: "I can move just fine. And I\u2019ve got something you don't."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391581
  - content: "This tracker is tuned to the Princess Frog\u2019s exact frequency.
      I can track it through these tunnels.\n"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391582
  - content: 'Then give it to Jay. He knows the tunnels better than any of us. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391584
  - content: "No. You need someone who knows how to read it. Some who can tell a
      signal apart from just noise. I\u2019ve been tracking this thing for weeks,
      I know its patterns! "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391585
  - content: And I said <i>no</i>. We are not having this argument again.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391586
  - content: Why? Why won't you let me do anything? I can help!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391587
    - rid: 314095765763391588
  - content: You want to know why?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391589
  - content: "Because you\u2019re exactly like <i>her</i>."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Rocky! I'm not like my Ma\u2014"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391590
    - rid: 314095765763391591
  - content: Listen, I worked with your mother for a long time.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391592
  - content: "She always held herself responsible for everyone\u2019s safety. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Because she was afraid of losing them. Of losing us.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: I watched her put herself on the line time and time again for the sake
      of someone else.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: But deep down, every selfless thing she did? Was ultimately for herself.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "She couldn\u2019t stand aside. Couldn\u2019t let someone else handle
      it. Because she couldn\u2019t bear to feel powerless."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: So ask yourself. What are you running from?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: What are you trying to prove to me, or yourself?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391593
  - content: "People with something to prove are a ticking time bomb. \n"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391594
  - content: "And I am <i>not</i> going to be the one who lets Ailin\u2019s daughter
      march into the dark to die."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391595
  - content: Jackie feels her throat tightening as she struggles to find the right
      words to say.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391596
  - content: "...You think I don\u2019t know my mom?"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391597
  - content: I know how isolated she felt. That she had to surround herself with
      so many others all the time.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391598
  - content: 'I know how powerless she felt. Like when she lost my Dad. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391599
  - content: And I know how selfish she was. Who leaves their fucking child to be
      raised by a stranger for fucks sake.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: I <i>know</i> that I'm being selfish right now.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391601
  - content: That by coming here, I'm probably worrying the hell out of Ives and
      Cam.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391602
  - content: "I'm being selfish\u2026 and yet, I\u2019m still asking to come."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391603
  - content: "Because I don\u2019t want to prove anything anymore."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391605
  - content: Once I find out what happened to my Mom, I just want to live a normal
      life with Cam and Ives.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "I\u2019ll quit the NITES."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "But that won\u2019t happen if I sit out now. They need closure too,
      not just me."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: The Wastelanders are our closest link to the truth.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: So I want to help all of you.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: "Because right now, you don\u2019t know the enemy you are dealing with.
      While I do."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391606
  - content: And you know how dangerous it is to fight an unknown enemy.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391607
  - content: "\u2026"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391608
    - rid: 314095765763391609
    - rid: 314095765763391700
    - rid: 314095765763391610
  - content: Kid's right, Cap. We might be over our heads on this one.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391611
    - rid: 314095765763391612
  - content: "Plus, she\u2019s made her decision, and it wouldn\u2019t be up to us
      to change it. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e1d6a8a99977249eb89967ed128a714c, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391613
  - content: <i>Jay gives Jackie a playful wink.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9eb64e5cd0fdbe944b654af85100bcb6, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391614
  - content: ...Fine.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391615
  - content: But you stay in the center formation and navigate with Kade. Jay, you're
      on point with me.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: If I say retreat, we retreat. No heroics. Capiche?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 58078335e5991451a946193b9f5f19ac, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Capiche.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 314095765763391616
    - rid: 314095765763391617
    - rid: 314095765763391618
    - rid: 314095765763391619
